  "solution": {
    "text": "As we know compound (4) is aromatic and the compound (1) is anti-aromatic. Hence compound (4) is most stable and compound (1) is least stable among these in compound (2) and (3) carbon atom having charge is $\\mathrm{sp}^3$ hybridised. On the basis of angle strain theory compound (3) is more stable than compound (2).\n<img src=\"assets\\st0002_769cf401071a.png\"/><br/>"
